# Migration 002 (Phase 6E data): a meeting can name the work items it actually discussed.
# A workstream steering meeting is recorded against the workstream (oversight); its agenda items say
# which activities were discussed, so attending it is engagement on those items only, never on every
# item in the workstream (docs/phase6-plan.md §18).

define
  relation meeting, relates agenda-item @card(0..);
  entity deal-item, plays meeting:agenda-item;
